<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Allow the measurement of the accuracy of a function against a reference implementation. This extension works on floating-point data and provide results in ULP.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_scalar__ulp_8hpp">glm/ext/scalar_ulp.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__vector__ulp">GLM_EXT_vector_ulp</link> </para>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__scalar__relational">GLM_EXT_scalar_relational</link></para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
